too few where LDBL_MANT_DIG is not a multiple of 4, plus one, so 0x1.111111111111281 rounded down and
0x1.11111111111111 up), dd856098 (a store at index -1 of the mantissa buffer when it wrapped) and 6426a515 (an inexact
denormal result that rounded up lost its ERANGE).

